Uncertainty is summarized with nonparametric bootstrap CIs for TPR@FPR (n=1000) [26]. For paired comparisons at fixed FPR across test sets we use the Wilcoxon signed rank test with Holm–Bonferroni. The workflow is summarized in Table 1. 
